{2050}{}{Hello. How are you doing?}
{3000}{}{You're welcome to take supplies if you need them, since your job is so important, but please don't take too much. We don't have much left.}
{3010}{}{[Done.]}
{4000}{}{Well Gahh! back to you . . . I'm sorry that you never learned to speak. We might have been good friends.}
{4010}{}{Ouph.}
{5000}{}{I'm not feeling very well. Someone cracked my head with a big pipe. I went to the medic
but my head still hurts. Sure hope someone catches the jerk that hit me.}
{5010}{}{Why did they do that?}
{5020}{}{Guck.}
{6000}{}{Well, they attacked me while I was here pretty late one night. Usually I go home by
eight or so, but I was staying late since someone had some water stolen and I was
checking our supplies. Next thing I know, I wake up in the med-lab with a big bump on my
head. Things are getting crazy around here. Someone is going to get killed for water
soon and I don't know what we can do about it.}
{6010}{}{Sorry. I hope you feel better soon.}
{6020}{}{I'll see what I can do.}
{7000}{}{Well, everyone's pretty nervous, of course, but we haven't had too much trouble. I hope you find a new chip soon.}
{7010}{}{We might have
 been good friends.}
{7020}{}{Say, what are you doing here?}
{8000}{}{I hand out the water rations, of course. And I make sure that nobody tries to take more
water than their share, though I don't think we'll have any trouble.}
{8010}{}{Hmm. Well, keep up the good work.}
{9000}{}{You too. I hope you find that chip soon so we can all go back to a normal life.}
